6%9B%B8%2F%E5%8D%B7061&oldid=7903772","revision_id":7903772,"edition":null,"accessed_on":"2026-10-20","raw_path":"sources/jinshu/wikisource-7903772-raw.wikitext","raw_file_sha256":"6e28403fc85f551b2aab898cac610180884ba0732a24a492f8ca514381b9978d","text_scope":"partial_chapter","review_status":"text_checked","license_url":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","normalization":{"description":"保數位原字；僅明示wiki wrappers及排版移除，完整raw與逐碼projection另存；未影像校勘。","omitted_digital_paratext":[]},"extent":"周浚及嵩、謨、馥完整選定單元；固定見證25段4069字，止於成公簡前，不是卷六十一全卷。"}}],"time_policy":{"unknown_is_not_unbounded":true,"attestation_is_not_tenure":true,"date_expressions_are_not_normalized":false,"date_normalization_coverage":"partial","normalized_year_numbering":"astronomical","civil_year_label_field":"chinese_civil_year","civil_year_label_coverage":"partial","regnal_year_crosses_ce_year_is_gregorian_projection":true},"assembled_identity":{"person_id":"3xx_gdy_or6_AABA","source_person_ids":["3xx_gdy_or6_AABA"],"representative_source_person_id":"3xx_gdy_or6_AABA","identity_equivalence_decision_ids":[],"parent_person_id":"3xx_gdy_or6_AAB","source_assertion_id":"a-jin061-song-daughter","collateral_root_group_id":null,"assembly_id":"fa-zhou-runan-pei-rui","root_person_id":null,"namespace_id":"3xx_gdy_or6","namespace_entry_person_id":"3xx_gdy_or6_A","collateral_root_group":{"id":"cg-zhou-pei-rui","type":"unknown_shared_father_from_qualified_first_cousins","status":"contextual_provisional","human_reviewed":false,"root_person_ids":["3xx_gdy_or6_A","3xx_gdy_or6_B"],"cousin_assertion_id":"a-jinshu061-congfudi-001","named_father_assertion_ids":["a-jin061-jun-father","a-jin061-fu-father"],"common_parent_person_id":null,"common_parent_name":null,"common_parent_registered":false,"relative_age":"unknown","biological_verification":false,"references":[{"work_id":"w-jinshu","book_id":"b-jinshu-061","source_id":"s-jinshu-061-ws7903772","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-061-zhou-family","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-061-zhou-family:p020","quote":"馥字祖宣，浚從父弟也。父蕤，安平太守。馥少與友人成公簡齊名，俱起家為諸王文學，累遷司徒左西屬。司徒王渾表「馥理識清正，兼有才幹，主定九品，檢括精詳。臣委任責成，褒貶允當，請補尚書郎」。許之。稍遷司徒左長史、吏部郎，選舉精密，論望益美。轉御史中丞、侍中，拜徐州刺史，加冠軍將軍、假節。徵為廷尉。","subject_person_mention_id":"c-jinshu-061-zhou-family:p020:m0000","object_person_mention_id":"c-jinshu-061-zhou-family:p020:m0005","assertion_id":"a-jinshu061-congfudi-001","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?title=%E6%99%89%E6%9B%B8%2F%E5%8D%B7061&oldid=7903772","scope":"古稱從父弟及兩端明父三證合讀；非明載裴蕤兄弟或共父姓名"},{"work_id":"w-jinshu","book_id":"b-jinshu-061","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-061-zhou-family","source_id":"s-jinshu-061-ws7903772","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-061-zhou-family:p001","quote":"周浚，字開林，汝南安成人也。父裴，少府卿。浚性果烈。以才理見知，有人倫鑒識。鄉人史曜素微賤，眾所未知，浚獨引之為友，遂以妹妻之，曜竟有名於世。浚初不應州郡之辟，後仕魏為尚書郎。累遷御史中丞，拜折沖將軍、揚州刺史，封射陽侯。","subject_person_mention_id":"c-jinshu-061-zhou-family:p001:m0004","object_person_mention_id":"c-jinshu-061-zhou-family:p001:m0015","assertion_id":"a-jin061-jun-father","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?title=%E6%99%89%E6%9B%B8%2F%E5%8D%B7061&oldid=7903772","scope":"古稱從父弟及兩端明父三證合讀；非明載裴蕤兄弟或共父姓名"},{"work_id":"w-jinshu","book_id":"b-jinshu-061","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-061-zhou-family","source_id":"s-jinshu-061-ws7903772","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-061-zhou-family:p020","quote":"馥字祖宣，浚從父弟也。父蕤，安平太守。馥少與友人成公簡齊名，俱起家為諸王文學，累遷司徒左西屬。司徒王渾表「馥理識清正，兼有才幹，主定九品，檢括精詳。臣委任責成，褒貶允當，請補尚書郎」。許之。稍遷司徒左長史、吏部郎，選舉精密，論望益美。轉御史中丞、侍中，拜徐州刺史，加冠軍將軍、假節。徵為廷尉。","subject_person_mention_id":"c-jinshu-061-zhou-family:p020:m0002","object_person_mention_id":"c-jinshu-061-zhou-family:p020:m0012","assertion_id":"a-jin061-fu-father","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?title=%E6%99%89%E6%9B%B8%2F%E5%8D%B7061&oldid=7903772","scope":"古稱從父弟及兩端明父三證合讀；非明載裴蕤兄弟或共父姓名"}],"rationale":"馥為浚從父弟的古代稱謂常規，合浚父裴、馥父蕤，推得裴蕤同父兄弟的名義父系結構；共同父無名，僅namespace結構槽，不創person或source_attested父子／兄弟。"},"status":"contextual_provisional","human_reviewed":false}}
